DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     cchheecckk checks the consistency of each named _f_i_l_e_s_y_s_t_e_m, by
     running /bbiinn/iicchheecckk and then /bbiinn/ddcchheecckk on it.

     Without -ss, cchheecckk only reports the problems it finds.  With
     -ss, cchheecckk also asks iicchheecckk and ddcchheecckk to repair what they
